{"date":"2026-10-25","caps":[[0.05,"Arnie Jordan here, coming to you from row three at Jordan Arena, with the Rinkside Report."],[5.08,"Thirty-five goals this week, if you count the shootout, and I do. And I've been recognized."],[10.17,"A lady one row down turned around and asked me if I was the podcast guy. I said yes."],[14.87,"She said, oh, I thought you'd be taller. I was sitting down. It was Sunday, October twenty-fifth."],[20.92,"First, a word for the stripes."],[22.5,"Shane and Chip had the whistles, three games back to back, and I'd bet they skated more miles than any team out there."],[28.57,"They called eight penalties all night, and three of them went to the same man, which in this league means you're done for the night."],[35.36,"More on him in a minute."],[37.26,"The early game was the Regatta Nordiques against Dawson's Oilers."],[40.95,"Whetlam opened the scoring, from Langlois and Roy, and Craigy tied it late in the first, set up by McPherson and, I checked this twice, Dawson."],[49.01,"The goalie. A goalie with an assist. That man passes better than half the fellas skating in front of him."],[55.6,"Now, I started a new page in the notebook, and at the top I wrote one word: Stuart."],[60.15,"Two trips in the first period, and a hook late in the second."],[63.51,"Three penalties, and in this league three is the limit, so Shane and Chip showed him the door."],[68.66,"Three strikes and you're out. Wrong sport, same result."],[71.69,"That left Brown to drop back onto the blue line and play defence for the rest of the night."],[76.68,"Before all that, Craigy's tying goal came while Stuart was sitting in the box. Shorthanded."],[81.67,"Craigy, cleaning up after his teammate like a fella with a mop at a wedding."],[85.84,"The Nordiques kept Stuart company: Andersen and Pulo for tripping, and Whetlam for a high stick, so Whetlam had a goal and a penalty."],[93.1,"The full combo meal."],[94.87,"McPherson put the Oilers ahead in the second, and Trigg came in to replace McKay in the Nordiques net."],[100.4,"In the third, Pulo tied it and Lawrence put the Nordiques ahead, then McPherson tied it again with forty seconds to go."],[106.85,"Tied at the buzzer, and in this league that means straight to the shootout. No overtime."],[111.62,"One shooter a side, and if they both score or both get stopped, you go again. Moorzy is the one who buried it."],[117.58,"Four to three Nordiques. McPherson had two goals and an assist and went home with nothing."],[122.47,"That's baking the whole cake and getting handed a cracker."],[126.27,"Game two, the Culp Habs beat the Keg Canucks eight to three."],[129.64,"Penney had the hat trick and an assist, Hering and Dixon each had a goal and three helpers, Clark had three assists, and Paul scored twice."],[137.39,"Koke, McMillan and Adam Short scored for the Canucks."],[140.37,"Halfway through, both teams changed goalies at the exact same second, again."],[144.63,"Rennie and Rico out, The Plug and Levar in. Two weeks running. Next week I expect a dance number."],[150.05,"And not one penalty all game."],[151.71,"Shane and Chip either had the quietest hour of their lives, or they left their whistles in the car."],[157.9,"Now, I have to tell you about upstairs."],[160.02,"Behind the glass, up top, that's where you'll find the fellas who already played."],[164.37,"Hot dogs, pizza, and the story of the goal they scored an hour ago, which gets prettier every time."],[169.67,"And every time their team scores down below, they pound on that glass like it owes them money, and they holler, and they cheer."],[176.45,"And then one of them always turns around and asks, can they hear us down there?"],[180.7,"Fellas, I'm in row three, and I can hear you. I can hear you chewing."],[185.03,"Then the late game, the ColdBreak Leafs against the Timbit Senators, and friends, sit down."],[190.25,"The Senators led seven to three in the second."],[192.91,"Obie had two goals and two assists, Simon Murphy had two goals, and Deakin, Holt and Sheridan chipped in."],[198.92,"Holt and Sheridan scored fifty-four seconds apart while Adams sat for tripping."],[203.45,"I took out a pen, a pen, and wrote: Senators in a cakewalk."],[207.48,"The Leafs then scored seven in a row."],[209.59,"Parsons got one late in the second, and Haroutunian scored forty-seven seconds into the third."],[214.86,"Then Collini scored three goals in one minute and fifty-five seconds."],[218.75,"A hat trick in less time than it takes me to climb to row three."],[222.36,"Parsons scored again, and Darren Horton finished it all by himself with fifty-one seconds left."],[227.68,"Ten to seven Leafs. Horton had five points, Parsons and Pierce had four each."],[232.01,"Upstairs, the glass took a beating. And Senators, Halloween's next weekend. You got your fright in early."],[238.51,"So that's your week: a shootout, a goalie with an assist, a man with his own page in my notebook, and a four-goal lead that went missing."],[245.92,"Thanks to Shane and Chip for keeping the peace, and for giving Stuart the early night."],[250.59,"If I got your name wrong, or gave your goal to the fella beside you, take it up with the refs, the timekeeper, and how fast you people move out there."],[258.69,"Tape your sticks. This has been Arnie Jordan with the Rinkside Report."]],"pages":[["ROW 3 - 10/25","no OT. straight to SO","too fast to write"],["ROW 3 - 10/25","need more pens","note: buy more pens"],["G1: Nordiques @ Oilers","Nordiques 1 - Oilers 1","Dawson in net: 3 GA","Whetlam 1G","Langlois: 1 assist"],["Nordiques 1 - Oilers 1","!Stuart: hooking +2 more - DONE","Craigy 1G 1A","!Commish: tripping","Pulo 1G"],["Nordiques 4 - Oilers 3  FINAL","McPherson 2G 1A!!","Trigg in net (swap)","McKay in net (swap)","Pulo 1G"],["G2: Canucks @ Habs","Canucks 3 - Habs 8  FINAL","Culp: 2 assists","Penney: 3 goals - HATS!","Tuby 1G 3A"],["Canucks 3 - Habs 8  FINAL","upstairs crew: LOUD","upstairs: pizza + yelling","hot dog #2","pizza smell. focus"],["G3: Leafs @ Sens","Leafs 0 - Sens 1","Obie 2G 2A!!","Murphy 2G!!","Deakin 1G"],["Leafs 10 - Sens 7  FINAL","Parsons 2G 2A!!","Haroutunian 1G 1A","Collini: 3 goals - HATS!","Horton 1G 4A"],["THAT'S THE WEEK","SHOOTOUT!!","page getting full","Tape your sticks!"]],"sleeper":{"team":"CAN","seed":5659},"kf":[{"t":37.26,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":1200,"h":0,"a":0,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":40.95,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":321,"h":0,"a":1,"goal":"WHETLAM","final":false},{"t":44.03,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":82,"h":1,"a":1,"goal":"CRAIGY","final":false},{"t":52.0,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":0,"h":1,"a":1,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":52.02,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":1200,"h":1,"a":1,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":94.87,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":759,"h":2,"a":1,"goal":"MCPHERSON","final":false},{"t":98.58,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":0,"h":2,"a":1,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":98.6,"g":0,"per":"3","clk":1200,"h":2,"a":1,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":101.16,"g":0,"per":"3","clk":673,"h":2,"a":2,"goal":"PULO","final":false},{"t":102.07,"g":0,"per":"3","clk":542,"h":2,"a":3,"goal":"LAWRENCE","final":false},{"t":104.16,"g":0,"per":"3","clk":40,"h":3,"a":3,"goal":"MCPHERSON","final":false},{"t":110.99,"g":0,"per":"3","clk":0,"h":3,"a":3,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":111.16,"g":0,"per":"SO","clk":0,"h":3,"a":4,"goal":"MOORZEY","final":true},{"t":126.27,"g":1,"per":"1","clk":1200,"h":0,"a":0,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":129.64,"g":1,"per":"1","clk":940,"h":1,"a":0,"goal":"PENNEY","final":false},{"t":130.8,"g":1,"per":"1","clk":504,"h":2,"a":0,"goal":"PENNEY","final":false},{"t":131.86,"g":1,"per":"1","clk":109,"h":3,"a":0,"goal":"TUBY","final":false},{"t":134.13,"g":1,"per":"1","clk":0,"h":3,"a":0,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":134.15,"g":1,"per":"2","clk":1200,"h":3,"a":0,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":137.39,"g":1,"per":"2","clk":1044,"h":3,"a":1,"goal":"KOKE","final":false},{"t":137.41,"g":1,"per":"2","clk":996,"h":4,"a":1,"goal":"KP","final":false},{"t":137.5,"g":1,"per":"2","clk":740,"h":5,"a":1,"